> f(x: u16) = x >> 16
> domain f
domain of f:
  x: u16, 0..65535
  defined at 0 of 65536 points
  empty domain: undefined at every point of the parameter types
  undefined e.g. at x=0; x=1; x=2; x=3
  C undefined behaviour at 65536 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> range f
range of f -> u16:
  empty (undefined everywhere)
  undefined at 65536 points
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> wrap f
wrap analysis of f:
  no wrapping or rounding operations
  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 65536 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> equiv f f
f and f: vacuously equal: the domain has no points to compare
